==Notes==
*It's wise to take them out early to prevent them from exploiting [[corpse]]s and quickly creating a sizable army of [[minion]]s.
*Their use of [[Jagged Bones]] can keep their minion army alive for a long time combined with [[Stone Summit]] [[monk]]s healing them.
